  {
    "id": "anno-izuhara_upper_p021_right-09",
    "type": "Annotation",
    "body": [
      {
        "purpose": "transcribing",
        "value": "但朝鮮ゟ差渡候漂民駕船護送使乘船且本藩ヨリ大坂長崎之間送"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "modern_jp_reading",
        "value": "ただし、朝鮮より差し渡し候漂民の駕船、護送使の乗船、かつ本藩より大坂・長崎の間、送"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "english_translation",
        "value": "Note (first column): the vessel on which the castaways sent over from Korea rode, the vessel the escort envoy boarded, and, from this domain across the stretch between Osaka and Nagasaki, the sending of them back —"
      },
      {
        "purpose": "identifying",
        "value": "漂民駕船船賃但書上"
      }
    ],
